{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"7da650fe7895478f7ba7ce61dd93cb791f0ab8b9ec7c0f58eb6d71d617c20f5f","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"f79246dcbe3084958855bbd70657548a590c59d79f499f18fb3748ceb25763ca","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"f7fa4d6ac65b1ac40ed3627604e2e7c6914ee775d28753888164e5ecb305fdbd","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-orcs/data/lore/misc.lua:45 原文 \"the deaths of Khulmanar and a great deal of our more expensive combatants at the hands of the Anomaly\"：the Anomaly 为大写专名，at the hands of 表示两者（含 Khulmanar）均死于该对象之手；译文「我们众多精英卫兵在那场异常中的牺牲」把施害者误作一次事件「那场异常」，且只挂在士兵上，丢失 Khulmanar 同为其所杀的关系；expensive combatants 译为「精英卫兵」也凭空添加了「卫兵」身份。"},{"revision_key":"f991285e5619a30d5902c2d6693f10873ddc6cab752d4e0af8c25c793624786b","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/other.lua:1603-1606：两处 \"pulled up to %d tiles\" 的上限限定词 up to 被删，「被拉向你 %d 码」把最大距离 t.distance 说成固定距离；且 \"special hook shot\"（钩索弹，技能核心效果）被泛化为「特殊弹药」，丢失钩拉含义。"},{"revision_key":"fa34f890d53f9f6166afe1a61d20e588957b2fc06951114665df4268da0c51b6","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"fa76ca18ae4532d705f80f1c49400fa0e134074ff79c4f680911639943df88cd","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"fa9e9b5cd31f17312878fd3b86ecce6bef6b947bc6fdf87f352a13b55cbf6c29","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/other.lua:1725-1728：原文 \"special antimagic shot\" 及 \"release antimagic sap on the target, doing %0.2f arcane resource burn damage\"，译文「特殊弹药」「造成 %0.2f 奥术燃烧」删去了反魔（antimagic）属性与在目标身上释放反魔汁液的效果描述，也丢失了 resource burn（燃烧资源）的含义。"},{"revision_key":"fb68502f3ed1af50ee41254ae61f54b2759570431a1f1d1bdb7f28a634c0864f","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-orcs/data/lore/slumbering-caves.lua:33 原文 \"my moment of weakness will soon have a wondrous result\" 指前文 \"coward that I was in those days\" 的过去一时软弱，译文「我现在的懦弱将会带来…」误为当下的懦弱，与前句「因为懦弱而存留至今」的时间关系矛盾；另外 31 行 \"Please, Your Brilliance, understand\" 被加入原文没有的「请饶恕我们」，与后文 \"I will not beg for Your forgiveness\" 相冲突。"},{"revision_key":"fc5bc20622d235a1d